{"id": "34609", "title": "还珠格格", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 27, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34609/34609s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34609.htm", "intro": "小燕子，古灵精怪，自幼以行骗跑江湖；紫薇，精通玲横书画，奉母遗命到北京寻父。\r\n　　两个背景不同、性格极端的女子相遇在几次混乱中，莫名的一见如故，甚而结拜为姊妹。\r\n　　从此，注定彼此在对方的生命里扮演一个重要角色。\r\n　　既为姊妹，两人之间当然没有秘密。\r\n　　这时，小燕子才知道紫薇千里迢迢来找寻的父亲，竟是当圣上　乾隆皇帝！\r\n　　看着弱不禁风的紫薇，小燕子决定冒生命危险将紫薇母亲交付的信物带给皇上，未料，乾隆却误将小燕子当成自己的女儿……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34609", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部  阴错阳差", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "2199214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "2199215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "2199216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2199217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "2199218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "2199219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "2199220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "2199221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "2199222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "2199223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部  水深火热", "volume": true}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "2199224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "2199225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "2199226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "2199227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "2199228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "2199229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "2199230.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "2199231.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "2199232.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三部  真相大白", "volume": true}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "2199233.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "2199234.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "2199235.html", "available": tru